<title>SPAIN: Siemens confirms deal with Amper.</title>
<headline>Siemens confirms deal with Amper.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>German electronics group Siemens will pay 14 billion pesetas to Spain's Amper S.A. for an 80 percent stake in Amper Elasa and a 10 percent stake in Amper Datos, a joint press statement confirmed on Monday.</p>
<p>Siemens intends to convert Amper Elasa into a global competitor in public telephony, finalising a basic deal struck on May 31, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2161</p>
